.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt SHUTDOWN 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm shutdown
.Nd stop services and power off or reboot the system
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl r
.Ar now
.Nm
.Fl h
.Ar now
.Nm
.Fl p
.Ar now
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility asks
.Xr svcd 8
to stop every running service except the live getty session, flushes file systems, then
requests the kernel power action:
.Bl -tag -width "-p"
.It Fl r
Reboot normally.
.It Fl h
Halt without powering off.
.It Fl p
Power off.
.El
.Pp
The operation requires effective uid 0.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A permission or kernel failure exits 1; a usage error exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr poweroff 1 ,
.Xr reboot 1 ,
.Xr svcd 8
